  "description": "Simplify dependency injection registration in .NET projects!\n            AutoYumYum lets you use attributes to register your services, eliminating repetitive DI setup.\n            Just decorate your classes, and AutoYumYum discovers and registers them with Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.",
