  "releaseNotes": "Added a Roslyn migration quick action for simple Microsoft DI registrations. It uses generated registration and skips unsafe cases. The Buy Me a Coffee build message is enabled by default and can be disabled with AutoYumYumShowSupportMessage=false; CI and design-time builds suppress it.",
